  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Torture Survivors (HRFT) 2020-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rehabilitering av tortyr&#xF6;verlevare (HRFT) 2020-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)Strengthening mechanism for coping with trauma caused by torture and gross and serious human rights violations

2)Strengthening the fight against impunity for torture and ill treatment

3)Strengthening civil, social and public actors and methods to fight against torture</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HRFT (Human Rights Foundation of Turkey) har ans&#xF6;kt fr&#xE5;n Sida om finansiering p&#xE5; 24,5 miljoner SEK f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra &quot;HRFT Strategic Plan 2020 - 2024&quot;. Sida bidrar med k&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r perioden januari 2020 till juni 2023. 

HRFT arbetar med att st&#xF6;tta tortyr&#xF6;verleverare med behandling och rehabilitering f&#xF6;r att uppn&#xE5; fysiskt, psykologiskt och socialt v&#xE4;lm&#xE5;ende, samt att st&#xE4;vja tortyr och andra former av illa behandling. 

HRFT har huvudsakligen fyra m&#xE5;l f&#xF6;r att uppn&#xE5; detta:
- Att arbeta mot tortyr i samh&#xE4;llet och konsekvenserna som f&#xF6;ljer hos utsatta individer samt deras sl&#xE4;ktingar genom att tillhandah&#xE5;lla rehabilitering och behandling;
- Att utveckla h&#xE5;llbara metoder och program f&#xF6;r att b&#xE4;ttre bem&#xF6;ta behoven hos tortyr&#xF6;verleverare;
- Att dokumentera kr&#xE4;nkningar av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter s&#xE5;som tortyr och annan illa behandling samt att driva juridiska processer f&#xF6;r att uppn&#xE5; uppr&#xE4;ttelse;
- Att bedriva p&#xE5;verkansarbete genom nationella och internationella partnerskap f&#xF6;r att gemensamt st&#xE4;vja tortyr.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HRFT (Human Rights Foundation of Turkey) has applied to Sida to implement &quot;HRFT Strategic Plan 2020 - 2024&quot;.  Sida will provide Core Support of 24,5 million SEK during the period January 2020 to June 2023.

The mission of HRFT is to support torture survivors with treatment and rehabilitation services in order to achieve a state of complete physical, psychological and social well-being, and to fight torture and other forms of ill-treatment.

This is being realized through four main elements:
- Negative impact and consequences of torture and ill treament on survivors and their relatives decrease;
- Sustainable and comprehensive programs for coping with the social trauma caused by gross and serious human rights violations, particularly torture and ill-treatment will emerge;
- Improvements/developments will be reached in regard to documenting torture and ill treament and starting legal processes for this crime;
- National and international efforts and pressure for necessary measures in preventing torture will increase.</narrative>
  </description>
